# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling and working notes. Deliberately NOT published.
#
# This repo is public. These directories are ~17 MB of third-party agent skill
# payloads and process scaffolding that have nothing to do with the site: they
# would dominate the file listing and language stats, and they document how the
# work was made rather than the work. Everything here still lives on disk —
# it is untracked, not deleted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.agents/

# Design working notes: benchmark scores, superseded directions, reference
# teardowns. Useful to keep locally, noise in a public repo.
.design/

# Standalone reference designs, including two that were built and rejected.
mockups/

# Agent instruction files. The genuinely useful engineering notes from these
# live in README.md instead.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.mcp.json
.graphifyignore

# derived artifacts
graphify-out/
.firecrawl/

# macOS-specific files
.DS_Store

# jetbrains setting folder
.idea/
skills-lock.json
